  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senior Advisor stakeholder engagement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment provides senior advisory support to strengthen stakeholder engagement and coalition building in preparation for the 2023 UN Water Conference co-hosted by the Netherlands and Tajikistan. The work focuses on identifying and mobilising a diverse range of partners&#x2014;including civil society, grassroots organisations, youth groups and actors from related sectors&#x2014;to contribute to the preparatory consultations and dialogue processes. The assignment also supports the development and coordination of a stakeholder engagement strategy to ensure inclusive and multi-sectoral participation in the lead-up to the conference.</narrative>
  </description>
